msgid "Technical choices"
msgstr "Elecciones tecnicas"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Rebel Editor is drawn using Rebel's renderer and :ref:`UI system <toc-"
"gui-basics>`. It does *not* rely on a toolkit such as GTK or Qt. This is "
"similar in spirit to software like Blender. While using toolkits makes it "
"easier to achieve a \"native\" appearance, they are also quite heavy and "
"their licensing is not compatible with Rebel Engine's."
msgstr ""
"El editor de Godot se dibuja utilizando el motor de renderizado y "
"el :ref:`sistema de interfaz de usuario <toc-gui-basics>` de Godot. No "
"depende de un kit de herramientas como GTK o Qt. Esto es similar en espíritu "
"a software como Blender. Si bien el uso de kits de herramientas facilita "
"lograr una apariencia \"nativa\", también son bastante pesados y su licencia "
"no es compatible con la de Godot."

msgid ""
"The editor is fully written in C++. It can't contain any GDScript or C# code."
msgstr ""
"El editor está completamente escrito en C++. No puede contener ningún código "
"GDScript o C#."

msgid "Directory structure"
msgstr "Estructura de directorios"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The editor's code is fully self-contained in the `editor/ <https://"
"github.com/RebelToolbox/RebelEngine/tree/main/editor>`__ folder of the Rebel "
"Engine source repository."
