msgid ""
"Rebel Engine's AudioServer currently uses 44100 Hz sample rate. When other "
"sample rates are needed such as 48000, either provide one or use "
"AudioStreamPlaybackResampled. Rebel Engine provides cubic interpolation for "
"audio resampling."
msgstr ""
"El AudioServer de Godot actualmente utiliza una frecuencia de muestreo "
